N('Hangi cümle doğru?','Although she was tired, she kept working.','although ... , ... (but kullanılmaz).',{'Although she was tired, but she kept working.': 'although ile but aynı cümlede birlikte kullanılmaz.', 'Despite she was tired, she kept working.': 'despite tam cümle almaz; although gerekir.'}),
N('Hangi cümle doğru?','I called him in order to ask about the exam.','in order to + V1.',{'I called him in order that ask about the exam.': 'in order that + özne + fiil ister.', 'I called him for ask about the exam.': 'for + V1 olmaz; to ask veya for asking gerekir.'}),
